{"endpoint": "pulls?state=open&per_page=50", "data": [{"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/yuan2go/importer-pc/pulls/99", "id": 4994351853, "node_id": "PR_kwDOVLQU8s8AAAABKa_C7Q", "html_url": "https://github.com/yuan2go/importer-pc/pull/99", "diff_url": "https://github.com/yuan2go/importer-pc/pull/99.diff", "patch_url": "https://github.com/yuan2go/importer-pc/pull/99.patch", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/yuan2go/importer-pc/issues/99", "number": 99, "state": "open", "locked": false, "title": "稳定性整改：DB9输入责任、双机生命周期、RCS与到期维护", "user": {"login": "yuan2go", "id": 96060646, "node_id": "U_kgDOBbnE5g", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96060646?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/yuan2go", "html_url": "https://github.com/yuan2go", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/yuan2go/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/yuan2go/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/yuan2go/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/yuan2go/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/yuan2go/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/yuan2go/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/yuan2go/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/yuan2go/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/yuan2go/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "body": "成功交给Application的输入此前仍可能只在内存排队，消费者失败/停止后缺少逐笔去向；普通诊断拥塞、慢marker和未排空后台I/O也会影响长期运行。本PR追加DB9持久接收责任与恢复检查，并完成双位故障隔离、真实停止所有权、受控历史到期及独立进展监督。\n\n工作包：WP-IPC-WIN11-24X7-STABILITY-REMEDIATION-01。开工main c5ac51d；后续只整合已由其他获授权工作合并的main c310705（PR97）和016976c（PR98），保留有效格口、跨页回执、意图/导航代次保护、字体及日志恢复，没有代合并其他PR。\n\n- 来源接收、持久Pending、业务Admitted和完成分开；每位worker公开状态/进展/深度/最老等待。前笔T3失败、满队列、取消、关闭与异常退出保留原输入责任，管理模式按原ID核对，不重放。\n- 诊断有界并计丢弃，实际探测写成功才恢复；marker落盘移出回调/跨位锁。读者4席位、管理命令2保留席位、管理状态独立合并1个在途读取，SQLite底层取消，查询/导出/CTS/订阅/真实停止任务完整归属；未停妥保有租约。\n- SDK缺单机分类、委托/缓冲/handle寿命与帧守恒修复；已开始native调用不伪称可取消。TCP保持按位/同位顺序/Epoch及既定重连，无虚构心跳。\n- RCS按用户要求保留Unknown原ID/报文/目标/合同/尝试/raw，不编造查询或重投。增加额度/10%预警、受控不重叠续配、永久高水位和恢复退役。\n- 现场可选7–30天；维护窗口先完整备份与校验，再删除到期已结明细。未决责任、实体/回复/测量/编号永久索引保留。分批事务、故障恢复及可选离线VACUUM；MaximumOperations不作总历史额度。\n- 索引/事务投影、后台授权I/O、UI/逐位/后台/资源独立监督；统一GUI/脚本OS门禁，补齐D盘ACL、SDK/NIC/电源/锁屏/RDP/更新与崩溃挂起政策。SQL1–8及历史证据身份不变。\n\n验证与身份：\n- 固定本地候选源码 **f9389241025aa83747e84753007b90cd20604533**；ZIP SHA256 **A91348FDDF1D21F840F16200AB37BD00EC3ADCD45A832EE2553F17F1AAC5FA44**。Sportmaster1.12.0 / Contracts1.17.0 / DB9；未发布、安装或操作生产设备。\n- 受影响AQA01、ResourceRisks、双TCP、RCS/心跳、快照/维护/升级恢复、窗口/版本回归及SDK托管探针已执行。最终f938924 EXE只读启动及同源原生管理/日志流程PASS。稳定性原生夹具a14c1d9仅补充首帧实际就绪的有界等待及断言，同一f938924冻结DLL的10项检查PASS，独立夹具身份和首次失败均保留。先前200d8ad任务链等结果保持原源码身份。\n- 259.2万条合成历史索引/投影规模单独验证；不代表同规模完整raw、目标8GB或持续运行。采集脚本5项测试PASS，交付可运行24h/72h采集与逐笔对账脚本。\n- 保留参数完整链的受保护目录ACL失败、受保护恢复缺安装者权限、旧audit03-rcs恢复隔离预期失配及首次固定夹具编译失败；没有删断言/绕过守卫换PASS。\n\n**尚未取得现场长稳资格**：真实Hikrobot双机/native停止重连、目标4核8GB、多Windows11版本、完整原件规模/RTO、预热后完整24h及72h/跨日均NOT_RUN。Unknown权威查询/处置合同未提供且用户要求先保留，BLOCKED。受保护恢复/到期CLI端到端仍需授权维护环境。\n\n[R01–R12结果及验证边界](https://github.com/yuan2go/importer-pc/blob/codex/win11-24x7-stability-remediation-01/docs/runtime/validation/win11-24x7-stability-remediation-01.md) · [原始证据/SHA](https://github.com/yuan2go/importer-pc/blob/codex/win11-24x7-stability-remediation-01/docs/runtime/evidence/win11-24x7-stability-remediation-01/README.md) · [运行、迁移/回退、到期删除和长稳命令](https://github.com/yuan2go/importer-pc/blob/codex/win11-24x7-stability-remediation-01/docs/runtime/win11-24x7-stability-remediation-01.md)\n\n首次Windows CI run40083342205在管理状态观察竞争命令席位时失败，保留原日志；修复并验证32并发观察合并、观察阻塞时撤销、完成后新读取、停止排空和迟到状态保护，原生断言未删除。最终head **5074660fd10e7a91d81923edac782891e377a519** 的 [CI run40084796638](https://github.com/yuan2go/importer-pc/actions/runs/40084796638) 两项均PASS：aqa01-boundaries、frozen-sportmaster。实际CI合并源码 **dd0c2f20dd02ea775520d3ed7a4554744bce3f98**，包括原生管理/日志回归和既有同源安装器工程打包；未发布正式安装包。托管Windows Server2025结果不能代替目标Windows11/真实设备/24h资格。\n\n既有CI门禁全部保留；新增有界故障/保留/采集器专项。托管CI以本PR精确head和实际合并源码另行计证，不借用PR97/98的旧PASS。", "created_at": "2026-10-24T09:47:19Z", "updated_at": "2026-10-24T10:17:50Z", "closed_at": null, "merged_at": null, "merge_commit_sha": "dd0c2f20dd02ea775520d3ed7a4554744bce3f98", "assignees": [], "requested_reviewers": [], "requested_teams": [], "labels": [], "milestone": null, "draft": false, "commits_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/yuan2go/importer-pc/pulls/99/commits", "review_comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/yuan2go/importer-pc/pulls/99/comments", "review_comment_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/yuan2go/importer-pc/pulls/comments{/number}", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/yuan2go/importer-pc/issues/99/comments", "statuses_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/yuan2go/importer-pc/statuses/5074660fd10e7a91d81923edac782891e377a519", "head": {"label": "yuan2go:codex/win11-24x7-stability-remediation-01", "ref": "codex/win11-24x7-stability-remediation-01", "sha": "5074660fd10e7a91d81923edac782891e377a519", "user": {"login": "yuan2go", "id": 96060646, "node_id": "U_kgDOBbnE5g", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96060646?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/yuan2go", "html_url": "https://github.com/yuan2go", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/yuan2go/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/yuan2go/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/yuan2go/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/yuan2go/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/yuan2go/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/yuan2go/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/yuan2go/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/yuan2go/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/yuan2go/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public",